{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14543","headline":"二灵寺守岁 · 戴叔伦","name":"二灵寺守岁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"守岁山房迥绝缘，灯光香灺共萧然。\n无人更献椒花颂，有客同参栢子禅。\n已悟化城非乐界，不知今夕是何年。\n忧心悄悄浑忘寐，坐待扶桑日丽天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14543.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14543","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}